docs/src/app/quick-start/page.mdx:48:The `select` command works with native `<select>` controls and standard ARIA `combobox` or `listbox` widgets. It matches exact values or labels, types into input-backed filters when needed, waits for associated custom options to render, and verifies the committed state. Use one value for single-select controls; native multiple selects retain multi-value behavior, while multiple ARIA values require an explicitly multiselectable listbox. The action uses CDP-managed browser sessions; WebDriver backends report it as unsupported.
